## 5. Data Requests Mapped to Each Source

| Source | Data Needed | Reason | Preferred Format |
|--------|------------|--------|-----------------|
| **JobBox** | Purchase/order history per CRM customer | 68K leads (22% of base) have zero purchase data. Even partial history unlocks personalized recs. | CSV: `phone, product_name, purchase_date, amount` or JSON API |
| **Changan** | Customer purchase records from the Changan partnership | 33K car owners are prime cross-sell targets (car accessories → MoltyFoam products). Currently zero data. | CSV: `phone, product, date, city` minimum |
| **Exhibition** | Conversion list: which exhibition leads placed orders after the event | 109K leads. Even a binary "converted / didn't convert" flag or list of phones that bought enables segmentation. | Excel / CSV: `phone, converted (Y/N)` or just list of phones that converted |
| **CFH** | Sales records from Celeste Home Fashion's POS or ordering system | 22K CFH customers are on a different system. Their home décor purchases would feed cross-sell recommendations (CFH → MoltyFoam bedding). | CSV or API access to CFH's order system |
| **POS** | Product category tagging for POS items | POS items return `product_type = "simple"` — categories are completely absent, breaking category-level analytics and filtering. | Either a product master list (`product_id → category`) or API fix |
| **OE** | No additional data needed | OE is the most complete source. Already feeding full recommendations. | — |

---

## Summary: Data Quality Normalization Rules — Source-Wise

| Source | Priority Cleaning Action | Impact |
|--------|-------------------------|--------|
| All sources | Normalize phone: `3xxxxxxxxx` or `03xxxxxxxxx` → `+923xxxxxxxxx` | Enables cross-source customer deduplication |
| All sources | Deduplicate customers by normalized phone across sources | Reduces 312K records to estimated ~250K actual unique people |
| Exhibition | Flag records with `Mobileno` length < 10 as invalid (122 records) | Removes unresolvable identity records |
| All cities | Title-case city names (`LAHORE` → `Lahore`) | Consistent province inference |
| OE (DB) | Fix `Islamabad Capital Territory` → `Islamabad` at insert time | Fixes 673 orders mis-aggregated in geographic analytics |
| POS (DB) | Map numeric product IDs to canonical SKU slugs via product master | Fixes cross-source product recommendation deduplication |
| POS (DB) | Populate `brand_name` for 54,797 `-` orders from product master | Fixes 19% of orders invisible in brand analytics |
